<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Friday 104,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Friday 104,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Actual interior Iowa and</p>
<p>southern Minnesota hog receipts:</p>
<p>Friday:  104,000, compared with estimate of 100,000.</p>
<p>Saturday: 15,000, compared with estimate of  20,000</p>
<p>Opening trade was not well established.  Early sales</p>
<p>Barrows and Gilts generally steady with midsession Friday.</p>
<p>				  Country		   Plants</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean</p>
<p>220-260 lbs	    54.50 -55.50	   55.50 -56.50</p>
<p>few			54.00  56.00	   55.00  57.00</p>
<p>few limited interest	  56.50		    57.50</p>
<p>Sows:  uneven, generally steady.</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-450 lbs   41.00 -45.00	   41.00 -45.00</p>
<p>450-500 lbs.	   43.00  47.00	   44.00  47.00</p>
<p>500 lbs-up	     45.00 -49.00	   46.00 -50.00</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
